{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2319790/extras/59631b70d9ba5ed99d1f851226e5525a.avif?t=1764332709\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2319790/extras_big/59631b70d9ba5ed99d1f851226e5525a.avif?t=1764332709 width=800 height=143 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2319790/extras/9135c6e2061170a62f809855d3470326.poster.avif?t=1764332709\" width=616 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2319790/extras/9135c6e2061170a62f809855d3470326.webm?t=1764332709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2319790/extras/9135c6e2061170a62f809855d3470326.mp4?t=1764332709\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Witness an <strong>elaborately hand-drawn, action-packed epic</strong> inspired by the <i>FPS greats!</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make use of the many <strong>devastating weapons in Wayne\u2019s arsenal</strong> and achieve <i>maximum destruction!</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Explore</i> dangerous locales through <strong>8 humongous areas</strong> all across Orca Isle!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HALF GAME, HALF CARTOON!</strong> Delight in the Captain\u2019s <i>depth-defying tale</i> in CAMPAIGN MODE as you <strong>view tons of animated cutscenes</strong> <i>exploring his adventure.</i>\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a <strong>high-octane soundtrack</strong> that emphasizes <strong>AGGRESSION and CHAOS!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go for the gold in our <strong>ENDLESS MODE</strong>\u2013<i>how long can you survive</i> the onslaught?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2319790/extras/5ee2e4564714a153774b704591ed2364.avif?t=1764332709\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2319790/extras_big/5ee2e4564714a153774b704591ed2364.avif?t=1764332709 width=800 height=143 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2319790/extras/e8529870a5b4c3f16f4690f4cf2ea256.poster.avif?t=1764332709\" width=616 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2319790/extras/e8529870a5b4c3f16f4690f4cf2ea256.webm?t=1764332709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2319790/extras/e8529870a5b4c3f16f4690f4cf2ea256.mp4?t=1764332709\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <i>hot pink-wearing, fish-chomping, cigar-huffing</i> <strong>Captain Wayne</strong> refuses to let anything stand between him and his gory conquest to rob and humiliate every rich asshole around the globe. <br><br>After losing his arm in a terrible encounter with the legendary <strong>Vampire Whale</strong>, Wayne replaced it with his trusty shotgun, <strong>The Captain's Ol' Reliable</strong>, and sailed with it across the seven-and-a-half seas in his vessel, the <strong>S.S. Salty</strong>. <br><br>When an unexpected run-in with a group of evil mercenaries leaves him marooned on <strong>Orca Isle</strong> with his ship stolen, Wayne starts doing what he does best: <strong>annihilating everyone responsible.</strong><br><br><i>Equipped with a double barreled shotgun for an arm,</i> countless explosives, and a bad attitude, you\u2019ll have to go toe-to-toe with <strong>The Killer Whales</strong>, the most ruthless mercenaries in all the seven-and-a-half seas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DO YOU HAVE WHAT IT TAKES TO EMBODY THE CAPTAIN? </strong>\u00a0Let\u2019s find out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2319790/extras/398b3bc986207ef060e5b5d2385966ff.avif?t=1764332709\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2319790/extras_big/398b3bc986207ef060e5b5d2385966ff.avif?t=1764332709 width=800 height=143 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2319790/extras/ebe46df394016c6d88319b079e143d6d.poster.avif?t=1764332709\" width=616 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2319790/extras/ebe46df394016c6d88319b079e143d6d.webm?t=1764332709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2319790/extras/ebe46df394016c6d88319b079e143d6d.mp4?t=1764332709\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Mow down enemies with your <strong>double-barreled arm</strong>, rip enemies apart with devious <strong>chain-gun fingers</strong>, toss a bottle of the <strong>explosive Boom Brew</strong>, unleash the <strong>force of thunder</strong> from your palms, or <strong>PUNCH THEM \u2018TIL THEY\u2019RE PASTE!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2319790/extras/5fd72ac4a39b43c61b49f372ce1402c5.avif?t=1764332709\" width=482 height=545 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2319790/extras/b3a698b678fac39f80e79c209f728032.avif?t=1764332709\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2319790/extras_big/b3a698b678fac39f80e79c209f728032.avif?t=1764332709 width=800 height=143 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Those Killer Whales bastards aren\u2019t gonna slaughter themselves! It\u2019s time to rob the rich to feed the badass.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Sea Legs","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2319790/945128c9a0d28216cbfadb851c681495f7d31530.jpg"},{"name":"Nobody Steals My S*#% And Lives","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2319790/4bea9c070bbef23754f9ac0df052ff70ec07fdd8.jpg"},{"name":"VIP Treatment","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2319790/4571031a5d5cd7ce49aeb634738b8bd6ac684812.jpg"},{"name":"Subatomic Eruption","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2319790/9573454f6b0c17d9292c197e59971bcec99fdd92.jpg"},{"name":"Raise Anchor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2319790/484e9e8fa6f66b60f470815a8b425ac078cb9fb9.jpg"},{"name":"From The Deep","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2319790/2fbd89d32a8c48840a29151bb1b81ca5a37b0269.jpg"},{"name":"Reinforced Steel","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2319790/b31c002baa109ac8883cdcba7876a2587b15eb0c.jpg"},{"name":"Night at Disco Castle","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2319790/aba04291a2e7f7b51e311c535758ce8a4e56e936.jpg"},{"name":"Down With The Airship","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2319790/76fbadfb58092fab76b225bc42d0de9213b08366.jpg"},{"name":"Toro, Toro","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2319790/bf6bfd0beb0d893a02d9251c65da285ef7b5f4d1.jpg"}],"total":29},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2319790?t=1764332709","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2319790/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764332709","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2319790/826663a7d968e220f53e1483cdee9a5d5588fc31/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764332709","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2319790/826663a7d968e220f53e1483cdee9a5d5588fc31/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764332709","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play on TV","id":43},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game features the ability to turn enemies into a globs of bleeding flesh via shotgun. On top of this, Wayne has a random chance of saying fuck, shit, or damn, at any given moment during the entire playthrough. We're sorry. It's just how he was raised."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2319790/extras/59631b70d9ba5ed99d1f851226e5525a.avif?t=1764332709\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2319790/extras_big/59631b70d9ba5ed99d1f851226e5525a.avif?t=1764332709 width=800 height=143 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2319790/extras/9135c6e2061170a62f809855d3470326.poster.avif?t=1764332709\" width=616 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2319790/extras/9135c6e2061170a62f809855d3470326.webm?t=1764332709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2319790/extras/9135c6e2061170a62f809855d3470326.mp4?t=1764332709\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Witness an <strong>elaborately hand-drawn, action-packed epic</strong> inspired by the <i>FPS greats!</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make use of the many <strong>devastating weapons in Wayne\u2019s arsenal</strong> and achieve <i>maximum destruction!</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Explore</i> dangerous locales through <strong>8 humongous areas</strong> all across Orca Isle!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HALF GAME, HALF CARTOON!</strong> Delight in the Captain\u2019s <i>depth-defying tale</i> in CAMPAIGN MODE as you <strong>view tons of animated cutscenes</strong> <i>exploring his adventure.</i>\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a <strong>high-octane soundtrack</strong> that emphasizes <strong>AGGRESSION and CHAOS!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go for the gold in our <strong>ENDLESS MODE</strong>\u2013<i>how long can you survive</i> the onslaught?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2319790/extras/5ee2e4564714a153774b704591ed2364.avif?t=1764332709\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2319790/extras_big/5ee2e4564714a153774b704591ed2364.avif?t=1764332709 width=800 height=143 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2319790/extras/e8529870a5b4c3f16f4690f4cf2ea256.poster.avif?t=1764332709\" width=616 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2319790/extras/e8529870a5b4c3f16f4690f4cf2ea256.webm?t=1764332709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2319790/extras/e8529870a5b4c3f16f4690f4cf2ea256.mp4?t=1764332709\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <i>hot pink-wearing, fish-chomping, cigar-huffing</i> <strong>Captain Wayne</strong> refuses to let anything stand between him and his gory conquest to rob and humiliate every rich asshole around the globe. <br><br>After losing his arm in a terrible encounter with the legendary <strong>Vampire Whale</strong>, Wayne replaced it with his trusty shotgun, <strong>The Captain's Ol' Reliable</strong>, and sailed with it across the seven-and-a-half seas in his vessel, the <strong>S.S. Salty</strong>. <br><br>When an unexpected run-in with a group of evil mercenaries leaves him marooned on <strong>Orca Isle</strong> with his ship stolen, Wayne starts doing what he does best: <strong>annihilating everyone responsible.</strong><br><br><i>Equipped with a double barreled shotgun for an arm,</i> countless explosives, and a bad attitude, you\u2019ll have to go toe-to-toe with <strong>The Killer Whales</strong>, the most ruthless mercenaries in all the seven-and-a-half seas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DO YOU HAVE WHAT IT TAKES TO EMBODY THE CAPTAIN? </strong>\u00a0Let\u2019s find out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2319790/extras/398b3bc986207ef060e5b5d2385966ff.avif?t=1764332709\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2319790/extras_big/398b3bc986207ef060e5b5d2385966ff.avif?t=1764332709 width=800 height=143 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2319790/extras/ebe46df394016c6d88319b079e143d6d.poster.avif?t=1764332709\" width=616 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2319790/extras/ebe46df394016c6d88319b079e143d6d.webm?t=1764332709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2319790/extras/ebe46df394016c6d88319b079e143d6d.mp4?t=1764332709\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Mow down enemies with your <strong>double-barreled arm</strong>, rip enemies apart with devious <strong>chain-gun fingers</strong>, toss a bottle of the <strong>explosive Boom Brew</strong>, unleash the <strong>force of thunder</strong> from your palms, or <strong>PUNCH THEM \u2018TIL THEY\u2019RE PASTE!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2319790/extras/5fd72ac4a39b43c61b49f372ce1402c5.avif?t=1764332709\" width=482 height=545 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2319790/extras/b3a698b678fac39f80e79c209f728032.avif?t=1764332709\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2319790/extras_big/b3a698b678fac39f80e79c209f728032.avif?t=1764332709 width=800 height=143 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Those Killer Whales bastards aren\u2019t gonna slaughter themselves! It\u2019s time to rob the rich to feed the badass.</p>","developers":["Ciaran Games LLC"],"dlc":[4212320],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2319790/4bdc90e26312c250bada6661449586d3c0f76ab3/header.jpg?t=1764332709","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"<strong>Captain Wayne